{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"昨日は撮影がありましたー"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/02/01/9029844/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"何かはまだひみつなのよー"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/02/01/9029844/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"*****HaPPy BirThDAy*****"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ひなちま♡2012.1.31"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"最近めきめきと綺麗になってきて\n眩しい！眩しいよ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ブログの写真があまりにも\nかわいくて即保存することとか\nよくあるんですよ、ほんとに。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"しゃべっててもおっとりしてるなあ\nもーかわいいなあ...\nなでなでしたくなります。\n逆にされることもあるけど"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/02/01/9029844/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あれ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まっすぐで何事にも一生懸命な\nひなちまだいすきです。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"切実に色気を半分わけてほしい。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"おめでとう"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/02/01/9029844/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"........."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ソファーに座って\nかまってもらってました。"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/02/01/9029844/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"伊藤ちゃんずです。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ウザいとか！はっっっ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ほんとは嬉しかったくせにっ！←"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"........."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ライブきた"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/02/01/9029844/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"デビュー1周年記念ライブ。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"幕張メッセ　イベントホールという\n大きな会場で乃木坂単独ライブが\nできるようになるなんて\nもう夢みたいに嬉しい！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"2月22日、平日ですが...\nみなさんと一緒に盛り上げたい！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"とにかく楽しみですわー"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/02/01/9029844/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/02/01/9029844/0006.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"突然ですが、髪の毛ぶんぶん振って\n顔が見えない右の子は誰でしょう。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ヒントはねねブログ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/02/01/9029844/0007.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まりか"}],"source":"archive"}